  "title": "I Stopped Paying for AI Coding Tools and Went Free Instead",
  "description": "NVIDIA just open sourced Nemotron 3 Ultra, a free 550 billion parameter AI model with a 1 million token context window, running up to 5x faster than other open models its size. I connected it to OpenCode, a free terminal coding agent, and gave it one prompt to build a full landing page with 3D visuals, no help after that. It planned, coded, and fixed its own mistakes. Full setup guide with exact commands here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Vrug93HD09z3nROBmRPCx2dFArwdMwNYtyf2W0EOLgc/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #AI #OpenSourceAI",
